Subject: [PATCH] rustic: close_container closes any menu a player has open

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/crates/horizon-client/src/game/lan_actions.rs b/crates/horizon-client/src/game/lan_actions.rs
